 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6z03FQIyQQgQ7kNvwGNYA3D&_nc_oc=AdpV6pRZmlE5qedY1kp-ulcimB64BXS0pIngeK-ddGhp1DaqWHix9omrSnwLCY9AD0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJHJ6EDtvItJMtXdz4tYr6aFahsW8aRWLl-X9qMo2AxFQ&oe=6A9D8441"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmUVDx091Y8Q7kNvwEzQyb0&_nc_oc=AdrcHVFxW_YaxcnEhMrqgTSsRTY3WEOB3FhnSByxHOMRgS9VVPJnMLg5QQRSRQjejQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZ5jU06ZAzQwIX5FQ2sg1Dk39qrd1qVMybAnzu-pTjkQ&oe=6A9D5966"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LSBD4gZAqXwQ7kNvwElMjim&_nc_oc=AdptR_G5723eH2ygvb5zlNDsQU6jSqD-J86_J6Cq1XKqou0Qzx7cqOjqs9sOTw4mB_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK30JYN8W5Oz4G43HCppm5skEf1YaZc9dmQ4k502xB8mg&oe=6A9D635C"}, {"fil